    <string name="settings_privacy_text">Everything stays on your phone. Your chats are locked with a key that never leaves your phone. Hain has no tracking. Only when Pim looks something up (weather, Wikipedia) does a short question go to that service, and you see it below.</string>
    <string name="settings_about_text">Hain is a small helper that thinks on your phone, without the cloud. Pim is the little drop that keeps you company. Hain is free and open source (GPL-3.0).</string>
